WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.400
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.734
And now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:08.167
President Biden
is expected to meet with

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.634
West Virginia
Senator Joe Manchin today

00:00:10.634 --> 00:00:13.534
to secure his vote for
the Build Back Better Act,

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:15.534
or, as it will be known
after the meeting,

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:18.267
the Build Back Coal Mines
and Nothing Else Act.

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:20.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:23.234
"Time" magazine today named
Tesla CEO Elon Musk

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:25.734
as its 2021 Person of the Year.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.834
He was going to go out and buy
a copy but then he realized

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:31.000
he'd have to pay taxes on it,
so it was, you know --

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.400
[ Laughter ]
Not worth it.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.934
President Biden signed
an executive order today

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:40.000
that directs lawmakers to
modernize government services

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.400
that directly affect Americans.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.367
For more details,
there's a number you can fax.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:49.734
Dr. Anthony Fauci said last week
that Santa Claus

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:52.000
is fully vaccinated against
the coronavirus

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.801
and that he also received
his booster shot.

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:57.934
Unfortunately, he put on
a few pounds during lockdown.

00:00:57.934 --> 00:01:03.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:06.501
Dr. Jill Biden said in a new
interview that being First Lady

00:01:06.501 --> 00:01:07.901
is harder than she imagined.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:11.200
Really? 'Cause the last one
didn't exactly make it look fun.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:16.834
Iowa Senator Chuck Grassley
complained on Twitter

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:20.067
over the weekend about DirecTV
dropping the History Channel

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:21.300
from his TV package.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.300
It was only the way
he could keep up

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.467
with his high school buddies.

00:01:24.467 --> 00:01:26.400
"Oh!

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.767
So, that's where
Thomas Edison went!"

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:30.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:33.033
"Such a snob, Edison!"

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:36.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:39.567
A new film adaptation of
the musical "West Side Story"

00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:41.367
was released over the weekend
in theaters,

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.901
and as usual, the Jets lost.

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:45.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:50.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:51.634
We were so nervous

00:01:51.634 --> 00:01:53.400
'cause we knew it was
coming out this year.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.701
We were so nervous
'cause sometimes

00:01:54.701 --> 00:01:56.434
we write jokes
six months in advance.

00:01:56.434 --> 00:01:59.300
And we were so nervous, 'cause,
like, what if the Jets are good?

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:04.634
And you remember, Shoemaker.
I said, "You know what?

00:02:04.634 --> 00:02:06.501
I think we can put it on cards."

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:11.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.367 --> 00:02:14.634
Jimmy Buffett's Margaritaville
restaurant resort group

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:17.300
has announced it will launch
a new cruise line next year.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.934
Though I don't know
if I like the idea of someone

00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:21.901
that relaxed running a ship.

00:02:21.901 --> 00:02:23.467
"Iceberg right ahead!"

00:02:23.467 --> 00:02:25.100
"Hey, man, it's probably
more scared

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.501
of them than we are of it."

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:30.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.801
Yesterday was former
"Price Is Right" host

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:34.467
Bob Barker's 98th birthday,

00:02:34.467 --> 00:02:37.534
which sounded too high,
so I guessed $1.

00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:41.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.767
A lot of our writers
had their days free.

00:02:43.767 --> 00:02:45.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:48.968
During the pandemic,
there were less meetings.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:52.667
Apple is set to release a new
iPhone software update that

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:56.267
includes a feature that detects
nude images to protect children.

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:58.968
And I can only hope
it also works on these.

00:02:58.968 --> 00:03:04.367
Aah!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.367 --> 00:03:07.100
So, people buy those and don't,
like, return them?

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:11.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:14.133
"We just assumed it would
eventually grow."

00:03:14.133 --> 00:03:15.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.834 --> 00:03:18.767
And finally, in honor of
National Brownie Day last week,

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:20.901
a Massachusetts cannabis company
created

00:03:20.901 --> 00:03:24.934
the world's largest pot brownie
that weighed 850 pounds.

00:03:24.934 --> 00:03:27.133
And to keep people from
accidentally eating it,

00:03:27.133 --> 00:03:28.767
they added walnuts.

00:03:28.767 --> 00:03:30.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.133
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

